### 登录获取 token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("redisToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 添加学生 401
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

{
  "id": "401",
  "name": "批量删除测试1",
  "age": 20,
  "score": 88
}

### 添加学生 402
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

{
  "id": "402",
  "name": "批量删除测试2",
  "age": 21,
  "score": 89
}

### 批量删除自己创建的学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/batch?ids=401&ids=402
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

### 批量删除不存在的学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/batch?ids=99999&ids=88888
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

### 批量删除包含别人创建的学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/batch?ids=401&ids=1
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 登录获取 token
# @name redisLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("redisToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 添加学生
# 如果 903 已经被删除，重新执行添加学生接口；如果 903 已存在，不要重复添加，可以换一个 id 测试。
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

{
  "id": "903",
  "name": "Redis缓存测试",
  "age": 20,
  "score": 88
}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 第一次查询学生详情，预期未命中 Redis 并查询数据库
GET http://localhost:8080/students/903
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 第二次查询同一个学生，预期命中 Redis
GET http://localhost:8080/students/903
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 修改学生，预期删除 Redis 缓存
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/903
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

{
  "name": "Redis缓存测试-已修改",
  "age": 21,
  "score": 95
}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 修改后再次查询，预期未命中 Redis，返回新数据并重新写入缓存
GET http://localhost:8080/students/903
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 删除学生，预期删除 Redis 缓存
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/903
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}

### Redis 缓存测试 - 删除后再次查询，预期返回学生不存在
GET http://localhost:8080/students/903
Authorization: Bearer {{redisToken}}
